1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,963
ArborKnowledge Studio connects professional
knowledge with verifiable provenance.

2
00:00:05,183 --> 00:00:10,380
A local tool for professional tree care. Produced
by RediON.

3
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:19,685
Expert knowledge lives in reports, research,
standards and experience. Source locations and
uncertainty can be lost during writing.

4
00:00:19,905 --> 00:00:23,774
Here, source, claim and decision stay connected.

5
00:00:24,324 --> 00:00:29,013
We record a source with provenance, rights and
authority level.

6
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:35,835
A fictional case becomes knowledge units. Every
unit points to a specific source location.

7
00:00:36,055 --> 00:00:40,792
The library shows which source supports each
statement.

8
00:00:41,342 --> 00:00:45,633
In the editorial workspace, these units are linked
to a chapter.

9
00:00:45,853 --> 00:00:49,647
Versions and comments make changes traceable.

10
00:00:49,867 --> 00:00:57,147
A chapter is approved only after human review.
Approval does not replace professional
certification.

11
00:00:57,367 --> 00:01:01,943
An approved book can be exported as an editable
DOCX.

12
00:01:02,493 --> 00:01:05,796
The same knowledge base can also support a course.

13
00:01:06,016 --> 00:01:11,409
The coverage view shows supported units and gaps
before learning begins.

14
00:01:11,629 --> 00:01:16,051
Learning progress stays local and is never silently
changed by AI.

15
00:01:16,601 --> 00:01:22,162
The vision brings sources, editing and learning
together in a controlled platform.

16
00:01:22,382 --> 00:01:30,008
Redion Cekrezi, Full-Stack and Applied AI
Developer. Upgrade humans. Not replace them.
